     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 10. Webster-style green-time optimisation. Left: \
uniform (50 s each) versus optimised green phase allocation across the five \
intersections. Middle: total delay drops from 8.44 to 7.73 veh s (8.4% \
reduction). Right: sensitivity at the busiest intersection showing the \
U-shape that gives rise to the optimum.\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
